Quiet on the board. The one ticket touched is the long-open homepage quotes task: two approved quotes are still needed to sit alongside the Carolyn and Tom image and video (the Bryan McCann quote on the site is already correct). It has been open since June and is marked Urgent. Key ticket: [MAR-389 — Collect quotes for Carolyn and Tom](https://linear.app/buildmidwestern/issue/MAR-389).

