### Vertical Buildout
The recruiting offerings landing page family is the live work and it grew this week. The parent page ticket remains In Progress with two sub-pages moving (Managed Sourcing and Fractional Recruiting / Embedded), and a new Retained Search sub-page was opened and started on 9/3, described as the page formerly known as Direct Placement. Brandon continues on the scoped sub-offering pages with progress tracked in Linear. Key tickets: [MAR-434 — Landing Page: Recruiting offerings](https://linear.app/buildmidwestern/issue/MAR-434), [MAR-1177 — Landing Page: Retained Search](https://linear.app/buildmidwestern/issue/MAR-1177), [MAR-442 — Landing Page: Managed sourcing](https://linear.app/buildmidwestern/issue/MAR-442).

